WEBVTT

00:03:25.493 --> 00:03:30.706
into the industrial economies and beyond
of where we are now.

00:03:32.166 --> 00:03:35.253
There's no one else for us to turn to.

00:03:35.294 --> 00:03:38.172
There's no one else for us to blame.

00:03:38.214 --> 00:03:40.007
There is no us and them.

00:03:40.049 --> 00:03:41.300
There's only us.

00:03:42.593 --> 00:03:48.140
So will we continue to be
the success story of the known universe,

00:03:48.182 --> 00:03:52.270
or are we writing our own obituary?

00:03:52.270 --> 00:03:54.897
The suicide species?

00:03:54.897 --> 00:03:59.110
Now I was raised
in an evangelical household.

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:01.946
We lived in end time.